scene/shape/group.go split: (axis == 0) => (!(axis == 0)) :: this still permutes every aligned member/box pair, splits into nonempty ranges and unions the same bounds; hierarchy layout and member order are unspecified, and the GPU rebuilds its own tree; scene/shape/testdata/group-hierarchy-equivalence.txt records the limits
scene/shape/group.go split: if axis == 0 { return point.X } => if axis == 0 { } :: this still permutes every aligned member/box pair, splits into nonempty ranges and unions the same bounds; hierarchy layout and member order are unspecified, and the GPU rebuilds its own tree; scene/shape/testdata/group-hierarchy-equivalence.txt records the limits
